{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"15":"Jihad (Kitab Al-Jihad)"},"section_detail":{"15":{"hadithnumber_first":2477,"hadithnumber_last":2787,"arabicnumber_first":2477,"arabicnumber_last":2787,"name_native":"كتاب الجهاد"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2574,"arabicnumber":2574,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن يونس، حدثنا ابن ابي ذيب، عن نافع بن ابي نافع، عن ابي هريرة، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" لا سبق الا في خف او في حافر او نصل","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":15,"hadith":98}}]}